        description: "Dr. Jeffrey Ling graduated from Massey University, New Zealand in 2013. He has experience working in academia, regulatory authorities, and small animal clinics. He is interested in preventive medicine and epidemiology. As he believes that prevention is better than cure, he hopes to work with pawrents to keep their pawkids healthy through many disease preventive measures. Also, as an avid learner, he attends continuing education events regularly to keep himself updated with current advances in veterinary medicine",
    },
